{"id":"wb-8-629","name":"青岛朝连岛灯塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"朝连岛灯塔","text":"朝连岛灯塔位于中华人民共和国山东省青岛市崂山区东南方黄海海域上的朝连岛（又称潮连岛、潮涟岛、褡裢岛、岔连岛）上，距陆地31.4千米。灯塔建于1902-1903年，为青岛现存最早建成的灯塔，现为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9C%9D%E8%BF%9E%E5%B2%9B%E7%81%AF%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94403973,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94403973","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b4ad76ded6025266d1578276.png","title":"青岛朝连岛灯塔_Leuchtturm_Tscha_Lien_Tau_Tsingtau.png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%9D%92%E5%B2%9B%E6%9C%9D%E8%BF%9E%E5%B2%9B%E7%81%AF%E5%A1%94_Leuchtturm_Tscha_Lien_Tau_Tsingtau.png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e4/%E9%9D%92%E5%B2%9B%E6%9C%9D%E8%BF%9E%E5%B2%9B%E7%81%AF%E5%A1%94_Leuchtturm_Tscha_Lien_Tau_Tsingtau.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"德意志帝国海军部 青岛档案馆馆藏","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​青岛朝连岛灯塔","width":320,"height":210}}